# Concrete imports

- Do not create `index.ts` / `index.tsx` files whose only purpose is re-exporting other modules.
- Import from the concrete implementation or type file, such as `~/entities/message/message.model` or `~/shared/ui/avatar`.
- An existing `index.ts` with real implementation can remain an entrypoint; do not turn it into a barrel or rename unrelated modules as cleanup.
- This convention applies to examples in documentation and skills as well as source code.
